        "text": "<thinking> To implement the password reset flow for a local account using an external provider, I will use the AWS SDK to interact with Amazon Cognito, a concrete external provider for user authentication and management. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK module and use Cognito's functionality to initiate the password reset process. </thinking>\n",
