    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `refresh_session.py` file that refreshes an expired session or access token using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific provider and use its identifiable elements in the code. I will use the Amazon Cognito service for this task, as it is a widely used service for managing user sessions and tokens. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865182944,
